{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>And he filled their vessels with grain.</b> Without measure. <b>And to return their money, every man into his sack</b> — without their knowledge; and therefore their hearts went out and they trembled. But the second money was with their knowledge. And the matter of the provisions he gave them was an act of kindness, for he let them know that he had no intention to harm them if the truth was with them — see, he gives them provisions so that they may be able to bring their brother."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 42, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:19:54.843866342Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}